ta.ta-statement:
[Viewer pick behavior] for filled-area primitives this ["click anywhere on
the drawn primitives"] includes: the edge, if edge visibility is 'on'; 
the interior, if the interior style is other than 'empty' or 'hollow'; 
and, the boundary, for interior 
style 'hollow'

Viewer behavior. See ... 'para'. 
